NAME
       basename - strip directory and suffix from a path

SYNOPSIS
       basename string [suffix]

DESCRIPTION
       Prints STRING with any leading directory components removed. If
       SUFFIX is given and the result ends with it, it is removed too.

EXAMPLES
       basename /usr/share/media/giphy.gif        -> giphy.gif
       basename /usr/share/media/giphy.gif .gif   -> giphy

SEE ALSO
       dirname(1), realpath(1)
